        {
          "text": "wakaambila abo baalumi kuti, Ndizi kuti Jehova wamupa nyika, alimwi iswe twasikilwa buyoofu nkaambo kandinywe, abantu boonse banyika balaya bumwaika kubusyu bwanu. ",
