        {
          "text": "Nkaambo twakamvwa Jehova mbwaakamuyuminizizya maanzi aa-Lwizi Lusalala ciindi eciya nimwakazwa kuEgepita, ambumwakacitila bami bobile ba-Amori ibakali kutala lya-Jordano, Sihoni a-Ogi mbemwakanyonyoona. ",
