        {
          "text": "Mbutwakamvwa buyo, myoyo yesu yakayaaya, katacikwe limbi bukozu mumuntu naba omwe nkaambo kanu, nkaambo Jehova Leza wanu ngu-Leza wakujulu awaansi ano. ",
