        {
          "text": "Kufumbwa muntu uuzwa muŋanda akuya bweendeenda anze, makani aakwe mwini, iswe tatukooyooba amulandu anguwe pe. Pele boonse ibayooba ayebo muŋanda, mulandu wesu na kukacitike cintu kulimbabo, ",
